ing billiards, a lounge, and a wet bar etc. (id:67604)"},"30325873":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554377900000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554377900000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554379970000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554378500000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554377900000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554377900000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639265554377900000/reb89/highres/6/R3169426_7.jpg"],"remarks":"2bed+den/ 2 bath ground floor unit available for rent in UBC Wesbrook. Large patio with separate entrance, could provide fully furnished, small pets okay. (id:67604)"},"30349201":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639264492774470000/reb89/highres/4/R3171054_12.jpg"],"remarks":"This stunning 1 bedroom, 1 bathr