289674519330000/reb89/highres/8/R3179318_14.jpg"],"remarks":"976 sf 2-level loft style penthouse, 1 bed + den, 1.5 baths, ample outdoor space Main floor is 676 sq ft. & features a fully equipped kitchen, den for office use, living/dining area with a gas fireplace, powder room, insuite laundry and storage under the stairs. Small deck off of living room. Upstairs is 300 square ft with primary bedroom, walk in closet & 4 pcs ensuite. Entrance to large 262 sq ft. roof top patio off of bedroom, perfect for entertaining. Comes with 1 parking stall/1 storage locker. Great Central Lonsdale location. Unit comes unfurnished (*Some photos virtually staged). (id:67604)"},"30459553":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639289036698530000/reb6/highres/3/R3179813_10.jpg"],"remarks":"Looking to rent out the upstairs portion of this lovely 3-bedroom, 1.5-bathroom home, nestled in a sought-after East Abbotsford neighborhood. Designed for comfortable above-ground living, this bright and welcoming home offers an abundance of natural light and a refreshing, open feel throughout. One of the standout features is that the entire home offers a bright and comfortable living and conveniently close to reputable schools, parks, shopping centers, restaurants, and other essential amenities. For more information or to schedule a viewing, please contact Harji Bassi @604-725-8094. (id:67604)"},"30478081":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_18.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_19.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639293902788130000/reb89/highres/9/R3181149_20.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/lis