ilding. (id:67604)"},"30499921":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639299195254730000/reb89/highres/2/R3182962_18.jpg"],"remarks":"Beautiful, 3year-new, North-East corner 3Bed + 2bath suite with A/C and a large wrap around balcony at City of Lougheed Tower 2.  (no window in 3rd bedroom) Beautiful laminate floor throughout. Steps to Skytrain station and Lougheed Mall. Beautiful Panoramic view of Golf course, Mountain & City. Great amenities including concierge desk, Sky garden & 