r conditioning. This beauty features many upgrades including gourmet kitchen with quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances including gas range, breakfast bar, large pantry and more. Lovely laminate floors, large bedroom, gorgeous spa-inspired bathroom and more. 1 parking included. Rooftop patio with amazing view of the Golden Ears. Close to rec centre and pool, shopping, restaurants, transit, police and fire station and more. No smoking, 1 pet upon approval. Available January 1st. $2,000/month plus hydro. 1 year lease and credit check required. Please email Leslie, Axford Real Estate and Property Management for your personal viewing. *Some pictures are of another unit in the building. (id:67604)"},"30547297":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639312334841970000/reb89/highres/5/R3186435_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/l